// (v0.9.606) A file request's blocking wait (retail 0x34B7F0, a virtual of three request classes: vtables at 0xD1B290,
// 0xD1B838, 0xD395F8): while the request's status (+0x48) is 1, the file system ([0x1104C38], its +0xA8) is pumped,
// the request's +0x50 called, then Sleep(10) (the call at 0x34B82E). The game's start loads the main menu's level
// through it: 0.9.606's first log, 433 such sleeps of 10.5 ms in the 5.56 s load (4.56 s), the file system pumped once
// each. During a fast load the sleep is a yield there, Sleep(0) (the loop as the game's; only its pumps more often):
// the main menu's level 5.56 s -> 2.69 s (Sleep(1): 3.07 s).
constexpr std::uint64_t kFastLoadingRequestWaitSleepSite = 0x0034B834ull;
constexpr DWORD kFastLoadingRequestWaitSleepMs = 0;

