// The hosted pistol graphs (wp_pistol.drm) already switch on the number of pistols: "Upper Body
// Weapon" and the post-combat "ground" graph both start in a "Weapon Mode Switch" ("How many
// weapons?") state and enter "Upper Body Dual Pistols" / "Dual Pistol Post Combat" when the pistol
