// v0.9.386: a load the game does outside GameStateLoading (the main menu's level, GameStateMenuing::InitMainMenu's
// MAIN_DoLoadLevel, on the Cutscene Viewer's way back) profiled as its loads are: the same counters and LoadProf line.
// Game thread; nothing when a session is already running.
namespace {
bool g_otherLoadProfile = false;
}
void BeginOtherLoadProfile() {
    if (!g_loadingProfilerAvailable.load(std::memory_order_acquire) || g_loadingProfileActive.load(std::memory_order_acquire))
        return;
    BeginLoadingProfileSession();
    g_otherLoadProfile = true;
    g_otherLoadFast.store(g_loadingFastModeSession.load(std::memory_order_relaxed), std::memory_order_relaxed);
}
void EndOtherLoadProfile() {
    if (!g_otherLoadProfile) return;
    g_otherLoadProfile = false;
    const bool fast = g_otherLoadFast.exchange(false, std::memory_order_relaxed);
    if (fast) RestoreFastLoadingRendererSetting();
    EndLoadingProfileSession();
    // (what the one-line LoadProf leaves out: where the frames and the waits went)
    LogLoadDetail("outside GameStateLoading", fast);
}

